WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.149 --> 00:00:09.360
Genghis Khan had over 500 wives and a vast
number of children: 1 in 10 people in Central

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:16.290
Asia today are his direct descendants.

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:23.789
Moon dust smells like gunpowder.

00:00:23.789 --> 00:00:29.419
Oranges and lemons smell different due to
chemically identical molecules that are mirror

00:00:29.419 --> 00:00:31.140
images of each other.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:34.540
An orange is essentially just a left-handed
lemon.

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:43.380
When Matt Smith became the 11th Doctor Who
in 2010, UK bow-tie sales doubled in a month.

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:50.330
You are 14% more likely to die on your birthday
than any other day.

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:56.130
The Inca's measurement of time was based on
how long it took to boil a potato.

00:00:56.130 --> 00:01:02.090
A typical microwave oven uses more electricity
keeping its digital clock on standby than

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:03.630
it does heating food.

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:10.510
The Sami people of northern Finland use a
measure called Poronkusema: the distance a

00:01:10.510 --> 00:01:14.430
reindeer can walk before needing to urinate.

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:20.070
The lead singer of Iron Maiden has a day job
as a Boeing 757 pilot.

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:26.350
Potatoes were illegal in France between 1748
and 1772.

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:31.060
In 1251, Henry III was given a polar bear
by the king of Norway.

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:45.890
He kept it in the Tower of London, on a long
chain so that it could swim in the Thames.

